    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "仕事の話の途中に呆けるなんて、良くないね",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だ\r\n……体調が悪いとかじゃないよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ぴんぴんしているさ\r\n今からライブだってやれるくらいだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あの手紙のこと、思い出しているのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……それは、その……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、責めてるわけじゃないんだ\r\nもし咲耶が悩んでいるなら、話を聞きたいだけだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ああ、そうだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
