    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "この企画、とても魅力的なものだと思う\r\n恋鐘たちと一緒に女子会なんて、楽しいに決まっている",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アンティーカのファンも喜んでくれると、\r\nそう確信しているよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、この仕事を受けたくないわけではないんだ\r\n……でも…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あの手紙の子のことを、考えてしまうんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もし、この仕事をしている私を見たら\r\nあの子はどう思うだろうか──",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……つい、そんなことを考えてしまう",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600303/1006003030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶は、優しいからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003030160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そんなことはないさ\r\nただ、優柔不断なだけだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
